    {
      "id": "gdh84js",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Volcanoes"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ef527t",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "vwtc5lv",
      "src": "/books/Guide/Cluster_035_GS & GK GUIDE BOOK/images/image_vwtc5lv.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Volcanoes are classified based on their eruptive activity (Active, Dormant, Extinct) and structural shape.",
        "Earthquakes originate at the Focus (Hypocenter), directly below the Epicenter on the Earth's surface.",
        "Seismic waves are categorized into Body Waves (P-waves and S-waves) and Surface Waves (L-waves).",
        "Earthquake intensity and magnitude are measured using the Mercalli and Richter scales, respectively."
      ],
      "id": "lns7603"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9spe9vu",
      "content": "A volcano is an opening in the Earth's crust through which molten rock (magma), gases, and ash are expelled to the surface. When magma reaches the Earth's surface, it is called lava."
    },
    {
      "id": "xcpdodo",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Structure of a Volcano"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qtkq0yl",
      "content": "• Crater – bowl-shaped opening at the top of a volcano."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dixbe5k",
      "content": "• Vent – the channel through which magma reaches the surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rf36h6i",
      "content": "• Magma Chamber – underground reservoir of molten rock."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uz790qj",
      "content": "• Lava Flow – molten rock flowing out during eruption."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k849836",
      "content": "• Ash and Gas – volcanic eruptions release ash, steam, and gases."
    },
    {
      "id": "9caszrl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Types of Volcanoes Based on Activity"
    },
    {
